*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Include          ZR_JIK_TEMP_ALV_CL1S01
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK B1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-001.
* ### ##
  PARAMETERS: P_CARRID LIKE SPFLI-CARRID "OBLIGATORY
                                        MEMORY ID CAR.
*                                        MATCHCODE OBJECT S_CARRIER_ID "#####

*  ### ###
  SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT 60(60) PX_CARRI FOR FIELD P_CARRID.
*### ## ##
  SELECT-OPTIONS : S_CONNID FOR  SPFLI-CONNID.

* ####
  PARAMETERS : P_CONTFR LIKE SPFLI-COUNTRYFR  DEFAULT 'DE'.

*## ##
  SELECT-OPTIONS : S_AIRPFR FOR  SPFLI-AIRPFROM.

SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK B1.

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
*   AT SELECTION-SCREEN.
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON VALUE-REQUEST FOR P_CARRID.
  PERFORM F4_CARRID USING 'P_CARRID'.

AT SELECTION-SCREEN ON VALUE-REQUEST FOR S_AIRPFR-LOW.
  PERFORM F4_AIRPFR USING 'S_AIRPFR-LOW'.


AT SELECTION-SCREEN.
  PERFORM CHECK_CARRID_NO USING P_CARRID CHANGING GV_ERROR_FLAG.
  IF GV_ERROR_FLAG = 'X'.
    MESSAGE S000 WITH GV_MESSAGE DISPLAY LIKE 'E'.
    LEAVE LIST-PROCESSING.
  ENDIF.
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Form check_CARRID_no
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& text
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*&      --> P_CSN
*&      <-- GV_ERROR_FLAG
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM CHECK_CARRID_NO  USING    PV_CARRID
                   CHANGING PV_ERROR_FLAG.

  PV_ERROR_FLAG = 'X'.

  IF P_CARRID IS NOT INITIAL.
    DATA(LS_SCARR) = GO_COMFUNC->GET_CARRID_INFO( P_CARRID ).
    IF LS_SCARR IS INITIAL.
*     #### ## ## ### No ###.
      GV_MESSAGE = GO_COMFUNC->GET_MESSAGE( IV_MSGNO = '100' ).
      EXIT.
    ENDIF.
    PX_CARRI   = LS_SCARR-CARRNAME.
  ELSE.
    CLEAR PX_CARRI.
  ENDIF.



  PV_ERROR_FLAG = SPACE.

ENDFORM.
